  "id": "absolutism",
  "term": "absolutism",
  "definition": "Absolutism, in aesthetics, is the view that beauty is objective rather than dependent on the observer, so there can be a fixed standard for judging what is beautiful. In this view, differences in taste reflect differences in people’s ability to recognize or appreciate that objective beauty.",
